  The reel_script says 'இவ்வளவு உயர்ந்த விலை' (such a high price) is what the 3-year claim refers to, which is roughly fine, but the headline and slides also say 'இல்லாத விலை' (no such price in 3 years) while the article says the 3-year-high was the price after 3 years; the slides_spec 'hl2' and the 'மேலும் உயருமா' line are not in the article: the article never says the price may rise further.
  slides_spec 'இது சின்னவெங்காயத்தின் புதிய உச்ச விலை' and 'விலை மேலும் உயருமா என்று பார்க்க வேண்டும்' - the second sentence (price may rise further, must watch) is an invented detail not in the article.
  slides_spec 'கடந்த 3 ஆண்டுகளில் இல்லாத விலை உயர்வு' and caption 'இல்லாத விலை' conflict with the article's statement that the price was highest in 2023 at Rs 180 and is now a new peak at Rs 200; the article's 'new peak' claim is stated as all-time high in the recent comparison, not a 3-year claim alone, and the reel says '3 ஆண்டுகளுக்குப் பிறகு', which mixes the headline's time claim with the 2023 peak fact.
  Slide 'விலை மாற்றம்' says 'கடந்த மாத தொடக்கத்தில்' prices were 120-140 but the reel_script mixes the 'இன்றைய' price with 'மொத்த விலை' and 'சில்லறை விலை' without the article clarifying which applies to the headline Rs 200; the headline Rs 200 is retail price, but the slide 'இன்றைய விலை' lists wholesale Rs 180 under the main heading, mixing two price types in one slide.
  The reel_script's first sentence says 'பு புளியம்பட்டியில் சின்னவெங்காயம் கிலோ 200 ரூபாய் வரை விற்பனையாகிறது' and then says the price was sold 'இந்த விலையில்' at the weekly market, which conflates the retail price with the market where the wholesale Rs 180 was reported.
